  "region_notes": {
    "china": "Chinese platforms commonly ask for a mobile number (mainland numbers use country code +86) and some verify real identity before you can post. ReachWeaver has not verified the current rule of any platform: read each platform's own help pages. If a form wants a phone number or identity document you do not have, stop. Do not borrow another person's, buy a number or an account, or use a bypass."
