  "human_steps": [
    "Open the official starting page yourself.",
    "Read the platform's own eligibility, terms, fees and age or identity rules.",
    "Type or paste the prepared details yourself. Create the password yourself in your password manager: it is not in this folder and ReachWeaver never sees it.",
    "Complete every CAPTCHA, SMS or e-mail code, two-factor step and identity or real-name check yourself.",
    "Accept the terms yourself.",
    "When the account exists, record it: reachweaver profile --handle PLATFORM:PERSONA=USERNAME (your own statement; ReachWeaver does not check it).",
    "Delete this folder: it contains personal data."
